Build hook for WinPad's probe frontend (FEX 14c9268, on top of 0008)

tests/probe is a minimal frontend that links FEXCore directly, without
FEX's Linux frontend: it maps one x86-64 test program, records its code
map, generates an AOT cache and runs it from a linked AOT image with
NoJIT. The iOS test app uses FEXCore the same way. Setting the CMake
cache variable WINPAD_PROBE_DIR to that directory builds it inside FEX's
tree, so it gets FEXCore's include paths and generated headers.

diff --git a/CMakeLists.txt b/CMakeLists.txt
index 0cdaa03..11eaf89 100644
--- a/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -640,6 +640,12 @@ add_subdirectory(FEXHeaderUtils/)
 add_subdirectory(CodeEmitter/)
 add_subdirectory(FEXCore/)
 
+# WinPad: a frontend kept outside this tree (its tests/probe) that links FEXCore
+set(WINPAD_PROBE_DIR "" CACHE PATH "WinPad probe frontend source directory")
+if (WINPAD_PROBE_DIR)
+  add_subdirectory(${WINPAD_PROBE_DIR} WinPadProbe)
+endif()
+
 if (NOT APPLE)
 if (ARCHITECTURE_arm64 AND NOT MINGW AND NOT BUILD_STEAM_SUPPORT)
   # Binfmt_misc files must be installed prior to Source/ installs
